   sender 192.168.48.9 / ...:44:09 sends   arrival is counted.
   three flows at once; tcpdump here       ARP LEGS -- the SOURCE side: sender
   also counts the DUT's ICMP              172.16.10.5 or 192.168.10.5; tcpdump
   unreachables                            here counts the replies
            |                                       ^           |
            |  -> 172.16.10.5   SUBJECT             |           |  who-has 172.16.10.1  SUBJECT
            |  -> 192.168.10.9  INSTRUMENT CONTROL  |           |  who-has 192.168.10.1 INSTRUMENT
            |  -> 172.17.10.5   NEGATIVE CONTROL    |           |  who-has 172.17.10.1  NEGATIVE
            v                                       |           v
   +--- port1.0.48 --------------------------------- port1.0.10 -----------------+
   |    vlan48  192.168.48.1/24                      vlan10                      |
   |  swi_d   AT-x960-56YSQ   S/N A2WQS700B   console u2                   DUT   |
